00:07:29.800 --> 00:07:35.680
into space, creating voids in the
surrounding gas.

00:07:36.560 --> 00:07:42.360
>> The amount of energy in these jets
[music] is staggering, soul-crushing,

00:07:40.560 --> 00:07:46.360
