00:09:28.200 --> 00:09:35.240
These jets travel incredible distances
through space.

00:09:32.400 --> 00:09:41.840
>> So, the largest known jet is about 1.4
megaparsecs in length. and a megaparsec

00:09:38.600 --> 00:09:46.320
is about 3 million light-years. So,
we're talking almost 5 million

00:09:43.960 --> 00:09:51.280
light-years from end to end.
>> Eventually, the jets do stop when they

00:09:48.560 --> 00:09:55.000
slam into the intergalactic medium, the
